3,1,,status,Victoria,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
4,1,,status,George,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
5,1,1,talk,Toshio,,We need to verify if past projects actually served their intended users well.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I am concerned about how much disruption the construction causes to daily timetables.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,George,,We must ensure the new plan does not just shift the workload to existing staff.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,I want to see if the delivery schedules have been consistently slipping in recent years.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,Let us look at the actual costs versus the approved budgets from the last three cycles.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Benjamin, cost accuracy is vital, but user satisfaction is the true measure of success.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Toshio, satisfaction is hard to measure if the rooms are unusable during the build.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,George,,I agree with Victoria. We need to know how long rooms are out of service.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@George, yes, the duration of outages is critical for our academic calendar.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,I will check the tender records to see if inflation is eating our margins.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Toshio,,We should also look at the post-occupancy reviews to see what users actually think.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Victoria,,"That makes sense. If the space is not used, the investment was wasted.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,George,,I am worried about the technicians who maintain these systems. They are stretched thin.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"@George, their workload is a major risk factor for any new installation.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I will also review the renewal reserve for equipment bought earlier to check for hidden costs.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Toshio,,Let us finalize our data requests. I will look at post-occupancy ratings and survey findings.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Victoria,,I will examine the timetable records and booking data to understand usage patterns.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,George,,I will check the staffing posts and the bench technicians' weekly manual routines.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,I will investigate the decade of delivery schedules and the weather days in site diaries.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,I will review the tender records and the renewal reserve for equipment bought earlier.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
